column4:
When Type=1 (Ally Obtained), an ally of quality X is obtained from channel Y; 1=Recruitment, 2=Exchange
When Type=2 (Ally Star Upgrade), an ally of quality X is upgraded to Y stars;
When Type=3 (Collection Obtained), a collection of quality X is obtained;
When Type=4 (Collection Star Upgrade), a collection of quality X is upgraded to Y stars;
When Type=5, 6 (Hire Ally), there are no parameters
When Type=7 (Guild Quiz), X indicates correct or incorrect, 1=Correct, 0=Incorrect"
